// neon.js — NÉON, a minimalist brick breaker (zero dependencies).
//
// Brick collision used to live inside the render loop `frame()` (see ISSUES.md
// #1/#2): the bounce was missing there, so the ball plowed straight through
// bricks. It now lives in `step()` — pure logic, no DOM — and `frame()` only
// draws.
//
// The module runs nothing on import: only `boot()` touches the DOM. Pure
// logic can therefore be imported from the tests (`node --test`) without a
// browser.

